                                                "sense_id": "7819555e-9207-3085-bb8f-5d428f0f008c",
                                                "text": "This will convex the fan and hold the cards more rigidly in place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2ccfb82-14c4-40fd-9f26-085f63223ed4",
                                                "sense_id": "7819555e-9207-3085-bb8f-5d428f0f008c",
                                                "text": "In one moment the body will convex the checkered blanket, and later—the featureless absence;"
